{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2022-07-15 08:06:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK COMMEMORATES 150TH ANNIVERSARY WITH GRANTS TO THREE GLOBAL NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS SELECTED BY ITS EMPLOYEES', 'text': "DALLAS , JULY 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS KIMBERLY-CLARK CELEBRATES 150 YEARS OF PROVIDING BETTER CARE FOR A BETTER WORLD, THE KIMBERLY-CLARK FOUNDATION ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL HONOR THIS MILESTONE ANNIVERSARY BY AWARDING THREE $150,000 GRANTS TO GLOBAL NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS THAT ARE WORKING TO IMPROVE THE WELL-BEING OF PEOPLE AROUND THE WORLD. SINCE ITS INCEPTION IN 1952, THE FOUNDATION HAS PROVIDED OVER $440 MILLION IN FINANCIAL SUPPORT TO TARGETED CAUSES THAT ALIGN WITH THE COMPANY'S SOCIAL IMPACT GOALS."}